# Example 07 — Staged global: GFS EXPLORE feeds top-K seeds into BFGS.
#
# When you suspect the loss surface is multimodal, do not start a local
# optimiser blindly: let GFS canvas the box first, snapshot the K best
# (loss, params) pairs, and feed each into a BFGS refinement.
# STRATEGY TYPE PRESTAGE picks the staged behaviour.

OPTIMIZER
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PRESTAGE
    LIB DLIB
    ALGO BFGS
    MAXEVAL 4
    TOPK 2
    EXPLORE
      LIB DLIB
      ALGO GFS
      MAXEVAL 6
    ENDEXPLORE
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_ERMSE 0 0.0001
PC_LAMMPS --script ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in --varloss Ecoh 8.10 800

OPTIM RCUT2B (1) 4.0 6.0
OPTIM SGRIDMB (1) 0.1 0.4

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
